  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">oreo fluff is a pillow of sweet nostalgia, perfect for summer potlucks or cozy nights in. Velvety cream cheese blends with fluffy whipped topping, sweetened condensed milk, and a splash of almond milk, then swirls with crushed Oreo cookies so every spoonful bursts with chocolatey crunch. No liqueurs needed here; pure vanilla extract keeps it family-friendly while still richly indulgent. Scoop it into bowls or cups, top with extra cookie crumbles, and serve up an irresistibly playful dessert that guarantees smiles with every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-oreo-fluff\">Why You’ll Love This Oreo Fluff</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-oreo-fluff\">How to Make Oreo Fluff</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-oreo-fluff\">Pro Tips for Making Oreo Fluff</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-oreo-fluff\">How to Serve this Oreo Fluff</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-oreo-fluff\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Oreo Fluff</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a no-bake dessert that&#8217;s super easy to whip up!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Rich, creamy texture that melts in your mouth.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly combines the classic Oreo flavor with a fluffy twist.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for parties, potlucks, or just a sweet treat at home.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Kids and adults alike will be begging for seconds!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-5905\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"5905\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-re